    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogosaria mamincha y’Atalia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(2 Abar 11:4-6)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase owaka o gatano na kabere Yehoyada akaba omoremu, akarangeria abatang’ani b’abasikari b’amagana, agakora okobwatana nabarabwo. Abatang’ani aba nabwo aba: Asaria, mosinto o Yerohamu, na Isumaeli, mosinto o Yehohanani, na Asaria, mosinto bw’Obedi, na Maaseya, mosinto bw’Adaya, na Elisafati, mosinto o Sikiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barabwo bakagenda ase ense yonsi y’Abayuda, bagasangereria Abalawi korwa ase emechie yonsi y’Abayuda amo nabateneneri be chiamate chi’Abaisraeli, bakagenda Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omosangererekano bwonsi ogakora okobwatana kw’ogotianania nomorwoti agwo ase enyomba ya Nyasae. Erio Yehoyada akabateebia, “Rora omwana bw’omorwoti! Tiga agambe, buna Omonene akwanete igoro y’ororeria rwa Daudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eke nakio morakore: Ase inwe abakuani na Abalawi, inwe abamokorenda ase rituko ri’Esabato, ensemo ya isato yaino inamobe abarendi b’ebiita;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na ensemo ende ya isato babe bakorenda enyomba y’omorwoti, na ensemo ende ya isato ase Egeita ki’Oboroso; na abanto bande bonsi babeere ime ase chiraaro chi’enyomba y’Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto onde bwensi tabaisa gosoa enyomba y’Omonene otatiga abakuani na Abalawi abwo bare ab’ekerisio. Abwo mbanyare gosoa, ekiagera bachenekire, korende abanto bande goika babwate omooroberio ochikiire n’Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalawi mbaetanane omorwoti, kera oyomo abe obwate ebirwanero biaye koboko kwaye; na monto onde bwensi orasoe ase enyomba eria goika aitwe akwe. Mobe amo nomorwoti aase ande onsi akogenda na koirana.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalawi na Abayuda bonsi bagakora onsi koreng’ana buna Yehoyada Omokuani abachigete. Kera oyomo akarenta abanto baye, baria barenge gokora emeremo ase rituko ri’Esabato, na baria barenge korua ase emeremo ase rituko riria, ekiagera Yehoyada Omokuani tabaete ribaga bagende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyada Omokuani akaa abatang’ani baria amatimo, ne ching’aya, ne chinguba echio chiarenge echia Daudi, chiabegetwe ase enyomba ya Nyasae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabeka abanto bonsi korenda omorwoti, kera omonto akaba obwate ebirwanero biaye koboko kwaye, bagatenena korwa ensemo ya Irianyi y’enyomba goika ensemo ya sugusu, bagaetanana egesasiimero na enyomba eria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio akarenta omwana oria bw’omorwoti isiko, akamobekera egutwa ase omotwe oye, naende akamoa Egetabu ki’Oborori. Yoashi akararigwa koba omorwoti, na Yehoyada na abamura baye bakamoaka amaguta, bagateeba, “Omorwoti ochie kare!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Atalia aigwete eriogi ri’abaanto barenge gocharoka‐charoka na gotogia omorwoti, agasoa enyomba y’Omonene ase abanto basangererekanete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na aroro akarora omorwoti oteneine ang’e nesiiro yaye agwo ase egesoero, na abatang’ani na abanto barenge kobugia ebitureeri mbateneine mbarabare ase omorwoti, na abanto bonsi b’ense eria nigo barenge nomochengo bakobugia ebitureeri. Abateria ababwate ebinto biabo bikobugigwa, bakaba batang’anete amatera ’ogotogia. Erio Atalia agatandora chianga chiaye, akarera, “Oko nokoregwa! Nokoregwa!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyada Omokuani agasokia abatang’ani b’abasikari b’amagana, akabateebia, “Mosokie isiko, mobeke ase egati y’abarendi, na moite n’omoro onde bwensi okomotunyana.” Omokuani nigo ateebete ng’a tibaabaisa komoitera ime ase enyomba y’Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio bakabwata omokungu oria, bakamoetia gochia ase enyomba y’omorwoti na bakamoira aroro ase Egeita gie Chibarasi, bakamoitera aroro agakwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehoyada okoirania abanto ase Omonene",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(2 Abar 11:17-20)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyada agakora okobwatana kw’ogotianania egati yaye omonyene na abanto bonsi amo nomorwoti, ng’a babe abanto b’Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio abanto bonsi bakagenda ase Hekalu ya Baali, bakayetagora bakayeiyeria inse. Ebisasimero biaye na emegwekano yaye bakabinachana ebing’ese, bagaitera Matani, Omokuani o Baali, agwo bosio bw’egesasiimero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyada akabeeka abarendi ase enyomba y’Omonene, bagatenenerwa nabakuani Abalawi, baria Daudi konya achorire batenenere enyomba y’Omonene. Barabwo babe bakorua ebing’wanso bi’ogosambwa ase Omonene, koreng’ana buna ariikire ase amachiiko a Musa. Naende babe bakorua ebing’wanso biria ase omogooko na amatera, buna aroberetigwe na Daudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabeka abarendi bakorenda ebiita bi’enyomba y’Omonene na gotanga omonto onde bwensi otachenegete tasoa ime.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega y’ayio akagenda amo nabatang’ani b’abasikari b’amagana na abanto basikire, na abagaambi b’abaanto, na abanto bonsi b’ense eria, akarusia omorwoti korwa ase enyomba y’Omonene, bakamoetia ase Egeita kia Rogoro gochia ase enyomba y’omorwoti. Bakamoikaransia ase ekerogo ki’oborwoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto bonsi b’ense eria bakaba nomogooko, na omochie okaba omotoereru ekiagera Atalia konya aitirwe n’omoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
